        <h2 style="text-align: center;" id="isPasted">Looking for a map of all roads in Parker County: <a href="https://www.parkercountytx.gov/94/911-Addressing" data-pasted="true">&nbsp;911 addressing&nbsp;</a></h2><p><strong>January 1, 2026</strong> additional voting precinct added to Parker County due to the number of registered voters in voting precinct exceeding 5,000 (TEC 42.006). &nbsp;Voting precinct 355 was split. &nbsp;FM 1189 will split this voting precinct with the &nbsp;west side being voting precinct 335 and east side being voting precinct 355. &nbsp; &nbsp;Approved by Parker County Commissioners Court on March 10, 2025.</p><p><a href="https://deegsnccu.maps.arcgis.com/apps/instant/basic/index.html?appid=0873fc79d00e4949b40905b0b2ecfce4" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Interactive Map</a> - This map is for informational purposes only. The Election Office specifically disclaims and accepts no responsibility for any errors or inaccuracies. There are no guarantees to the accuracy of this data and therefore placing all liability on the user concerning the use of this data in any way.&nbsp;</p><p><a href="/DocumentCenter/View/13204" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Complete updated county map with all voting precincts</a> - January 2026:</p><p><a href="https://www.parkercountytx.gov/DocumentCenter/View/12925/Precinct-Map-2026" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Parker County Commissioner Precinct Map</a></p><p><img src="/ImageRepository/Document?documentId=14078" class="fr-fil fr-dib" alt="Screenshot precicnt map" style="width: 854px;"></p><h2 class="subhead1" style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://dvr.capitol.texas.gov/House/56/PLANH2316" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Map for State Representative 60</a></h2><h2 class="subhead1" style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://dvr.capitol.texas.gov/SBOE/56/PLANE2106" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Map for State Board of Education District 11</a></h2><h2 class="subhead1" style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://dvr.capitol.texas.gov/Senate/56/PLANS2168" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Map for State Senate Parker County 10 &amp; 30</a></h2><h2 class="subhead1" style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://dvr.capitol.texas.gov/Congress/56/PLANC2193" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Map for Congressional District Parker County 25 &amp;12</a></h2><p style="text-align: center;"><br></p><p style="text-align: center;"><br></p><p><br></p>
    </div>

